# Dependencies and generated builds
node_modules/
**/dist/
**/target/
**/.build/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/artifacts/
!apps/nexus/artifacts/
apps/nexus/artifacts/*
!apps/nexus/artifacts/.gitkeep
!apps/swarmera/artifacts/
apps/swarmera/artifacts/*
